        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Introduction</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Exorcists&quot; is a 2D action game. A variety of enemies will appear in the game, including Chinese zombies, Japanese and ancient Egyptian monsters. After defeating them, the character will gain experience and level up. Their abilities will then be enhanced, making it easier to clear the stages. In addition, there are various mysteries and legendary enemies, can you solve the mysteries and defeat them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160460/extras/b59dcb4dbc7e6659758586605341371b.avif?t=1764065098\" width=1558 height=754 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160460/extras/50cec168030409ee6c8b45fa36e0a808.avif?t=1764065098\" width=1560 height=674 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160460/extras/72a333323434219269217325a90b1111.avif?t=1764065098\" width=1560 height=812 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160460/extras/4676604e8d9ab7df6d495463b0e00223.avif?t=1764065098\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Character: You can choose Hua or Lisa, and can switch them in the middle of the game; <br>2. Map: The characters can walk around the town, gather information and buy items; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Stages: There are 15 stages in total; <br>4. Skills: Hua and Lisa have different skills and abilities;   <br>5. Leveling Up: The character will gain experience and level up by defeating enemies. After leveling up, level-up points can be assigned to improve the character's abilities; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Attributes: Different enemies have different attributes, and it is easier to defeat them with favorable equipment;  <br>7. Mysteries: Mysteries exist in specific stages;  <br>8. Legendary Enemies: Legendary powerful enemies hidden in specific stages, defeat them to get special items;  <br>9. Endings: More than one ending is available;  <br>10. Hard mode: After defeating the final boss, hard mode can be chosen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Background</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the peaceful town Florence, various strange things have happened recently, including evil spirits occupied a mansion, possessed people, missing children, strange legends, etc.. The strange things have plagued the residents, made everyone feel helpless and even despaired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hua, who just arrived, and Lisa from the church have incredible talents. Can they solve these strange things with their power, find and eliminate the culprit, help the residents of the town, and make the town return to peace and happiness? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For authentication purpose, to play this game: <br>1. Internet connection is required;  <br>2. Steam client must be running;  <br>3. In the Steam client, Steam user must be logged in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Controllers</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X: Confirm / Hop Backwards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Y: Cancel / Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B: Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Guard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LT1 ~ RT2: Skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back: In-game Menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the controller doesn't work properly, please disable the controller Steam Input for this game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160460/extras/c082ae11d31135275892d81eed4954b3.avif?t=1764065098\" width=1560 height=691 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Keyboards</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160460/extras/En_smaller.png?t=1764065098\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Introduction</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Exorcists&quot; is a 2D action game. A variety of enemies will appear in the game, including Chinese zombies, Japanese and ancient Egyptian monsters. After defeating them, the character will gain experience and level up. Their abilities will then be enhanced, making it easier to clear the stages. In addition, there are various mysteries and legendary enemies, can you solve the mysteries and defeat them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160460/extras/b59dcb4dbc7e6659758586605341371b.avif?t=1764065098\" width=1558 height=754 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160460/extras/50cec168030409ee6c8b45fa36e0a808.avif?t=1764065098\" width=1560 height=674 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160460/extras/72a333323434219269217325a90b1111.avif?t=1764065098\" width=1560 height=812 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160460/extras/4676604e8d9ab7df6d495463b0e00223.avif?t=1764065098\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Character: You can choose Hua or Lisa, and can switch them in the middle of the game; <br>2. Map: The characters can walk around the town, gather information and buy items; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Stages: There are 15 stages in total; <br>4. Skills: Hua and Lisa have different skills and abilities;   <br>5. Leveling Up: The character will gain experience and level up by defeating enemies. After leveling up, level-up points can be assigned to improve the character's abilities; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Attributes: Different enemies have different attributes, and it is easier to defeat them with favorable equipment;  <br>7. Mysteries: Mysteries exist in specific stages;  <br>8. Legendary Enemies: Legendary powerful enemies hidden in specific stages, defeat them to get special items;  <br>9. Endings: More than one ending is available;  <br>10. Hard mode: After defeating the final boss, hard mode can be chosen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Background</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the peaceful town Florence, various strange things have happened recently, including evil spirits occupied a mansion, possessed people, missing children, strange legends, etc.. The strange things have plagued the residents, made everyone feel helpless and even despaired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hua, who just arrived, and Lisa from the church have incredible talents. Can they solve these strange things with their power, find and eliminate the culprit, help the residents of the town, and make the town return to peace and happiness? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For authentication purpose, to play this game: <br>1. Internet connection is required;  <br>2. Steam client must be running;  <br>3. In the Steam client, Steam user must be logged in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Controllers</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X: Confirm / Hop Backwards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Y: Cancel / Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B: Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Guard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LT1 ~ RT2: Skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back: In-game Menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the controller doesn't work properly, please disable the controller Steam Input for this game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160460/extras/c082ae11d31135275892d81eed4954b3.avif?t=1764065098\" width=1560 height=691 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Keyboards</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1160460/extras/En_smaller.png?t=1764065098\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
